# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF on all platforms.
#
# Prettier is configured with the default `endOfLine: "lf"`, so without this a Windows
# clone using `core.autocrlf=true` fails `npm run format:check` on files it never touched:
# the content is correct and only the checkout differs. Pinning `eol=lf` here makes the
# check behave identically on Windows and Linux without asking contributors to change
# their global Git configuration.
#
# `text=auto` still lets Git detect and leave binary files alone. No file in this
# repository requires CRLF, so there are no exceptions.
* text=auto eol=lf
